# Upload set for `gcloud builds submit` (deploy/cloudbuild.yaml). CODE ONLY: data, models and documents are read from
# the lake (BigQuery + gs://fcc-soft-sensor-sim-data) at runtime — see deploy/Dockerfile.
.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.next-build/
**/.next-*/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.md
# ...except the FCC explainer: served by GET /api/explainer and read by Gemini at runtime (11 Oct 2026)
!cockpit/api/app/copilot/fcc_explainer.md
/docs/
/meity_compliance/
/knowledge/
/sim_octave/
/scripts/
cockpit/api/artifacts/
cockpit/api/tests/
cockpit/web/tests/
cockpit/web/dev.log
cockpit/web/artifacts/
cockpit/web/test-results/
cockpit/web/playwright-report/
